<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P rates Sabre NZ Ltd's CP programme A-1.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Sabre NZ Ltd's CP programme A-1.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it assigned Sabre New Zealand Ltd's NZ$500 million asset-backed commercial paper programme an A-1 rating.</p>
</text>
